g\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/39/drfe8kr57scfd398yfdv9pm4fdryih0.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%87%9D%E9%A6%99%E7%83%88%E7%BB%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/39/drfe8kr57scfd398yfdv9pm4fdryih0.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />凝香烈绽\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，行动开始时，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"暗香\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">暗香</font></span></span>]的敌人，施加随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"2级减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">2级减益</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合；对拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"暗香\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">暗香</font></span></span>]的敌人，魔攻额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，行动开始时，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>格内拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"暗香\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">暗香</font></span></span>]的敌人，施加随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"2级减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">2级减益</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合；对拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"暗香\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">暗香</font></span></span>]的敌人，魔攻额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>；目标每拥有1个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]，对其暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">1%</font>，最多<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，行动开始时，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>格内拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"暗香\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">暗香</font></span></span>]的敌人，施加随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"2级减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">2级减益</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合；对拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"暗香\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">暗香</font></span></span>]的敌人，魔攻额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>；目标每拥有1个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]，对其暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">2%</font>，最多<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"远见之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/3cci05qpyelokxmo1facd15gigt8ao7.png/40px-%E8%BF%9C%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/3cci05qpyelokxmo1facd15gigt8ao7.png/60px-%E8%BF%9C%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/3cci05qpyelokxmo1facd15gigt8ao7.png/80px-%E8%BF%9C%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，二级：60<img alt=\"远见之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/3cci05qpyelokxmo1facd15gigt8ao7.png/40px-%E8%BF%9C%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%